# 7ZUZ project rules

- The UI is Hebrew, RTL by default. Use logical properties (`ms-`/`me-`, `ps-`/`pe-`, `text-start`) instead of left/right.
- Never hardcode colors or fonts. Use only design tokens (CSS variables / Tailwind theme) and shadcn components.
- Every screen has loading (skeleton), empty and error states.
- Minimum touch target 44px, visible focus, WCAG AA contrast, mobile-first.
- Never put secrets in front-end code. Secrets live only in environment variables, and `.env` files are git-ignored.
- Keep components small, typed and reusable. No dead code, no TODO placeholders in finished work.
- Do not install new dependencies without stating why.
